msgctxt "#30062"
msgid "Threaded Renderer"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30063"
msgid "Draw the picture on a second thread, a scanline range at a time, while the CPU runs on. Output is identical either way. Worth it where there is a spare core to draw on; on a single-core machine it only adds the cost of handing work across. Changing this takes effect on the next content load."
msgstr ""
